

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:108
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_ffd88855:

    # "As I approached the gates, two guards crossed their halberds in front of me."
    "当我走近大门时，两名卫兵将戟交叉挡在我面前。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:111
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_62408989:

    # "One of the guards addressed me with a heavy, hallowing voice:"
    "其中一名卫兵用低沉肃穆的声音对我说道："

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:113
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_87c5b731:

    # GUARD "Your leave permit, scout."
    GUARD "出示你的离营许可，侦察兵。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:114
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_e79ed82a:

    # MC "Huh?"
    MC "啊？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:115
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_f00a0734:

    # GUARD "Present your leave permit, as dispatched by your direct commanding officer."
    GUARD "出示你的离营许可，由你的直属指挥官签发。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:116
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_db7eaca7:

    # "The guard sized me up."
    "卫兵上下打量着我。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:117
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_29634847:

    # GUARD "That would be Captain Duprey."
    GUARD "也就是杜普雷上尉。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:118
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_684e944c:

    # GUARD "And I suspect you have no such permit."
    GUARD "我猜你根本没有这玩意儿。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:120
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_11238190:

    # GUARD "About-turn!"
    GUARD "向后转！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:121
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_45c36ccf:

    # "I watched them stand still for a moment and then turned around, disappointed."
    "我看着他们纹丝不动地站着，随后失望地转过身。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:123
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_391d3752:

    # MC "(It seems like I'm not getting out anytime soon.)"
    MC "(看来我一时半会儿是出不去了。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:124
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_73ac8739:

    # GUARD "Double-march!"
    GUARD "跑步走！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:125
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_18c47396:

    # MC "*Sigh* Sir yes sir..."
    MC "*叹气* 是的长官..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:132
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_61356499:

    # "That was the building they dragged that poor recruit towards."
    "那就是他们把那个可怜新兵拖进去的建筑。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:133
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_a65eabce:

    # "Rows of actual comfy beds, shelves full of various potions and tools, civilian-looking people hurrying about past me..."
    "一排排真正的舒适床铺，装满各种药水和工具的架子，平民模样的人匆匆从我身边经过..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:134
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_172c8f4d:

    # "It was clearly a section of the fort fully devoted to supporting our physical well-being."
    "这显然是堡垒中专为保障我们身体健康而设的区域。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:136
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_e5bd48af:

    # RECRUIT "Ow! What are you~"
    RECRUIT "嗷！你们在~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:137
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_3fa31f5f:

    # "Over at the corner of the room, a nurse and a physician were likely putting that recruit's face back together."
    "在房间角落，一名护士和医师可能正在修复那个新兵的脸。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:138
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_098a2684:

    # "As I remembered the scene in vivid details, a snapping sound echoed across the room."
    "当我清晰地回忆起那一幕时，一声脆响在房间里回荡。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:140
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_49cf0693:

    # RECRUIT "{b}Aaaagh!!!{/b}"
    RECRUIT "{b}啊啊啊!!!{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:141
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_c20f5bef:

    # MC "(On the upside, he won't have no face time with Captain Duprey anytime soon.)"
    MC "(往好处想，他短期内不用面对杜普雷上尉了。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:142
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_48a8e4c1:

    # MC "(I should go to the training area now.)"
    MC "(我现在该去训练场了。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:143
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_73f8592e:

    # MC "(I don't want to end up in here, one way or another.)"
    MC "(我可不想以任何方式沦落到这里。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:148
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_d0e0fdb1:

    # "I approached the door and a guard standing beside it turned to face me:"
    "我走近门口，站在旁边的卫兵转身面对我："

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:151
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_3d0d779c:

    # GUARD "You have no business at the Captains office, recruit."
    GUARD "新兵，你无权进入上尉办公室。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:152
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_a6793028:

    # "His tone was even but surprisingly chill."
    "他的语气平稳却出奇地冷淡。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:153
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_ba40941c:

    # MC "Yeah, I'm just looking around."
    MC "是，我只是随便看看。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:154
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_ec88e290:

    # GUARD "Sure, just don't bother me as you play inquisitor around here."
    GUARD "行，但别在这儿扮演审讯官来烦我。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:155
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_6c2dfd73:

    # "I nodded and stepped back."
    "我点点头退后。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:157
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_2f9aca4a:

    # MC "(A guard who doesn't sound like he's eating babies for breakfast, who would've thought.)"
    MC "(居然有个说话不像拿婴儿当早餐的卫兵，真是没想到。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:162
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantGoToMedwardOrTrainArea_c1db863b:

    # "I should go to the barracks as instructed."
    "我该按指示去营房。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:163
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CantGoToMedwardOrTrainArea_0d4c21ad:

    # "Last thing I want is for these guards to skewer me for displaying any disobedience..."
    "我最不想因为这些卫兵觉得我不服从命令而被捅个对穿..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:168
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_21ccfdff:

    # "I was approached by a rather hostile-looking guard."
    "一个面相不善的卫兵朝我走来。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:171
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_2bb61eb1:

    # GUARD "Recruit! What are you doing loitering about after dark?!"
    GUARD "新兵！天黑后还在外面闲逛什么？！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:172
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_e55c35a9:

    # MC "I was just~"
    MC "我只是~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:174
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_d07274a3:

    # GUARD "I will escort you to your bunk now!"
    GUARD "我现在就押你回铺位！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:175
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_0db79806:

    # MC "*Sigh* Alright, alright..."
    MC "*叹气* 好吧，好吧..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:178
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_a94b4f28:

    # "The guard did as he declared, following me around and even standing beside me as I was undressing to go to bed."
    "卫兵说到做到，一路跟着我，甚至在我脱衣就寝时还站在旁边。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:179
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_d738ea4e:

    # GUARD "Sweet dreams, soldier!"
    GUARD "做个好梦，士兵！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:190
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_YourBunk_1a080f4b:

    # "My bunk."
    "我的铺位。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:205
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_YourBunk_0fa8e0c6:

    # MC "(I won't be allowed any pillow-time with the sun still up.)"
    MC "(太阳还没下山，我可没资格躺下休息。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:231
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_TalkKiaraSuicidePill_c398b803:

    # "I noticed 琪亚拉 standing somberly near the barracks' entrance, inspecting some trinket around her neck."
    "我注意到琪亚拉神情阴郁地站在营房入口附近，摆弄着脖子上的小挂饰。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:232
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_TalkKiaraSuicidePill_9bae01fe:

    # "It was a small type of vial with some liquid sloshing about inside that I'd seen only on the women scouts."
    "那是个小玻璃瓶，里面晃动着液体，我只在女性侦察兵身上见过。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:233
translate zh qst_ForgedInFire_TalkKiaraSuicidePill_d4ba20bf:

    # MC @ talk "Hey."
    MC @ talk "嘿。"

